 <name>gmssl</name>
 <channel>pecl.php.net</channel>
 <summary>PHP extension bindings for the GmSSL cryptographic library</summary>
 <description>
GmSSL-PHP provides PHP bindings for the GmSSL C library, including SM2, SM3,
SM4, SM9, ZUC, random generation, and X.509 certificate helpers.
 </description>
 <lead>
  <name>Zhi Guan</name>
