 </version>
 <stability>
  <release>stable</release>
  <api>stable</api>
 </stability>
 <license uri="https://www.php.net/license/3_01.txt">PHP-3.01</license>
 <notes>
Fix PHP 8 named-parameter reflection for certificate verification, add
unencrypted SM2 private-key PEM import/export helpers, improve GmSSL library
detection, update release metadata, and add cross-platform CI coverage.
 </notes>
